  "resolution": "Nonidentity, independent existence, non-inherence and cognitive relation-closure are four different commitments. DistanceObjection uses non-inherence plus a disputed grounding bridge; EpistemicObjection uses explicit knowledge closure. Neither follows from the foundation’s numerical or ontological separation. Mediation rejects knowledge closure while leaving entity nonidentity intact.",
